      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im a property manager in phoenix and im dealing with a tenant who says their bedroom isnt staying cool even though the AC is running constantly. the rest of the house seems fine. what are some common reasons why just one room would be struggling like this?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
